    <string name="hoenn_welcome_title">Welcome to Hoenn Forge</string>
    <string name="hoenn_welcome_body">An unofficial fan project - not affiliated with Nintendo or The Pokémon Company. This app does not include Omega Ruby or Alpha Sapphire.\n\nYou bring a dump of a game you own; Hoenn Forge gives it a modern handheld home - tuned graphics, dual-screen play, and an optional randomizer.</string>
